    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "When parents are completely inbred, these expressions can be simplified by letting $ V_{P_1} = V_{P_2} = C_{P_1, P_2} $, and $ \\overline{C}_{P_1, r} = \\overline{C}_{P_2, r} $.",
