    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Second, inferences can be made regarding the relative numbers of dominant alleles carried in different inbred lines. The geometric relationship between the",
      "source_page": 635,
      "printed_page": 615,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter20:p027:b10"
      ],
      "bbox": [
